Pippinus major domus idemque rex Francorum.
Karolus <NOTE N="1214" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0883" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0883"></COL> K. magnus E1.</NOTE>  rex Francorum et <NOTE N="1212" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0883" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0883"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  E1.</NOTE>  patricius Romanorum, primus imperator in <NOTE N="1215" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0883" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0883"></COL> imp. Francorum E1.</NOTE>  Francia.
