ut historici volunt, propagandae dominationis
libidine <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest 2 (ubi</HI>  dom. suae). 3 <SUP>a</SUP> . p. causa 3 <SUP>b</SUP> . 4. 5. p. fame causa 6.</NOTE>  arma foris extulit cruentamque vitam
quinquaginta <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> LII. 5.</NOTE>  annis <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> q. a.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  3 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  per totam Asiam bellis
