 <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> sevictam 2.</NOTE> , vires suas nosse, et non lacte pecudum set
sanguine hominum vivere, et ad postremum <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> extremum 5.</NOTE>  vincere,
dum <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> d. v. vincere 2.</NOTE>  vincit <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> vincitur
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ex Orosio scribendum erat.</HI></NOTE> , docuit. Novissime Zoroastrem
Bactrianorum <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> bractianorum 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  regem, eundemque magicae <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> maice B 2.</NOTE> , ut
ferunt <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> fertur 2?</NOTE> , artis <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1091" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1091"></COL> artem 3 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  repertorem, pugna oppressum interfecit.
