tocius <NOTE N="114" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1093" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1093"></COL> totiusque c. o. et l, exc. 6.</NOTE>  civitatis occursu excipiebantur et laetitia,
 <COL N="1094B"></COL> et ob <NOTE N="115" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1093" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1093"></COL> ex 6. ab B 4.</NOTE>  hoc Alba porta nominata <NOTE N="116" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1093" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1093"></COL> nominatur 1. 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . nominatam 3 <SUP>b</SUP> . nominata est 5. 6. est nominata C 3.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(174)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1094" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1094C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Altthor</HI>  usque ad nostra tempora germanico
