pulchritudine ceteras portas excelluit <NOTE N="121" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1093" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1093"></COL> excellebat 3. 5. 6. excellunt B2.</NOTE> , et ob hoc
