 <COL N="1095A"></COL> non minus quam 100 <NOTE N="(176)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1095" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1095D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Centum—deludebantur</HI>  ex Vita S. Eucharii,
Act. SS. Ian. I, p. 919:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Treviros pervenerunt; ubi
