 <POEM COM="1098"><L><HI REND="ITALIC">Treberis innumeris bellorum compta triumphis,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Cum populis fortes sibi quinque subegerat urbes;</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">A quibus immensum consuevit tollere censum</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Quo locupletari cepit nimis et dominari.</HI></L></POEM></NOTE> .</P> <P COM="1098">6 <NOTE N="208" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1097" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1097"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  VII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn.</HI></NOTE> . Post multos vero annos hae quinque urbes
