291. <NOTE N="1170" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1127" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1127"></COL> ducent XII. 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  Maximianus <NOTE N="(242)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1128" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1128C"></COL> Haec narratio ex Historia martyrum Treverensium
