primum <NOTE N="1277" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1131" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1131"></COL> primo 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . quod  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2.</NOTE>  quod idolis immolare
