ejus servus successioneque indignus per patriarcham
Anthiocenum</HI> <NOTE N="1330" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1133" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1133"></COL> antiochenum 1. 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">alii, hoc loco.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Agricium renovans, confirmo</HI> <NOTE N="1331" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1133" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1133"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ad
