Damaso papa: qui <NOTE N="(285)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1138" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1138B"></COL> Quid haec sibi velint, equidem divinare nequeo.</NOTE>  ipse <NOTE N="1425" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1137"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B. C. et ipse 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  Mars gentiliter appellatur,
