tertia Hunorum sub Attila</HI> <NOTE N="(h)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1137" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1137"></COL> Totila  <HI REND="ITALIC">S. Gisl.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">rege eorum et
