addictus est ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an.</HI>  383), cum <NOTE N="1440" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">post suppl.</HI>  1.</NOTE>  Eutrochia Delfidi <NOTE N="1441" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1139"></COL> perfidi 4. 5. 6.</NOTE> 
