etsi eum plerique <NOTE N="1457" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1139"></COL> plurimi 2. 5. 6.</NOTE>  insidias evasurum non crederent,
iter <NOTE N="1458" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1139"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  iter 1. et 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . intus 4. 5.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  ingressus <NOTE N="1459" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1139"></COL> inegressus 1. i. in hoc 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  est, hoc solo dolore <NOTE N="1460" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">e corr.</HI>  1.</NOTE> 
