ad i.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  B. C.</NOTE>  direxit. Quod ubi Martinus <NOTE N="1467" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1139" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1139"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  comperit,
