 <POEM COM="1146"><L><HI REND="ITALIC">Quam bene concordes divina potentia jungit</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Membra sacerdotum quae ornat locus iste duorum,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Eucharium loquitur Valeriumque simul.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Sedem victuris gaudens componere membris,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Fratribus hoc sanctis ponens altare Cyrillus,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Corporis hospitium sanctus metator adornat.</HI></L></POEM></NOTE> ; juxta quos et ipse requiescit <NOTE N="1664" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1145" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1145"></COL> requieuit 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> .
