ferreis catenis suspensum <NOTE N="2084" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1161"></COL> suspensi 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .—et in qua  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  2. in qua  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  5. in aqua jacebant
XII c. m. 6.</NOTE>  13 jacebant corpora
martirum, quorum nomina <NOTE N="2085" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1161"></COL> q. n. eorumdem 5.</NOTE>  aureis litteris in ejusdem
criptae parietibus erant descripta. Religiosi igitur
 <NOTE N="2086" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1161"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1 <SUP>b</SUP> . viri B 6.</NOTE>  qui tunc erant Christiani, timentes, ne per
hujus scripturae indicium ludibrio, ut dictum est,
