 <NOTE N="2090" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1161"></COL> quomodo quando 5. 6. quando  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  quomodo a quo occisi sunt <NOTE N="2091" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1161"></COL> sint simul in 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . sunt simul in 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . o.
simul in 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> , in plumbea scriberetur
