et horum nominum <NOTE N="2093" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1161"></COL> nomina vel translationes 1 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  translationis causam <NOTE N="2094" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1161" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1161"></COL> causa 6. causam  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  causa C
1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita</HI>  C 3  <HI REND="ITALIC">sqq.</HI></NOTE>  et
