 <POEM COM="1167"><L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Epitavium Erberti</HI>  (ita cod.).</L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Pontificum decus, ecclesiae clarissima lampas,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Pax et amor populi, totius gratia cleri,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Hic jacet, Egbertus lucis regione repertus,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Praesul Trevericus, sed et aulae conditor hujus,</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Rexit et ecclesiam senos denosque per annos</HI></L> <L><COL N="1168D"></COL> . . . . . . . .  <HI REND="ITALIC">novenis atque diebus.</HI></L> <L><HI REND="ITALIC">Omnes dilectum prece commendate patronum.</HI></L></POEM></NOTE> , quam ipse construxerat
