episcopus ad <NOTE N="2490" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1177" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1177"></COL> in 6.</NOTE>  Lucelenburch <NOTE N="2491" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1177" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1177"></COL> lucenleburch 1. luscelenburch 1 <SUP>b</SUP> . luzelenburc 2. luscelemburch
4. luzelenburch 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> . 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . luzelenborch 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . luzelenbruch 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  in <NOTE N="2492" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1177" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1177"></COL> ad 6.</NOTE>  custodiam
