regiminis. Hic opera a decessoribus suis <NOTE N="2791" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> a suis predec. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  incepta,
 <COL N="1193C"></COL> scilicet monasterii sancti Petri amplificationem,
