corr.</HI>  suevorum 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">rec. manu in</HI>  C1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr.:</HI>  i. swevorum.</NOTE> 
quod Tuingia <NOTE N="2796" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> turingia 4. tuvigia  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  tuuingia 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .
Mingia 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . tumgia 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . tuingia B4. 5. twingia C.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(484)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1194" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1194C"></COL> Tubingen; cf. Bruno De bello Sax. c. 61,
103, Ekkeh. a. 1077 et Stenzel. I, p. 437 n.</NOTE>  vocatur <NOTE N="2797" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> dicitur 5. 6. quod  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  obiit ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an. 1078
Nov.</HI>  13), relatusque a Treberensibus, in monasterio
 <NOTE N="2798" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> monasterium 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  sancti Petri sepultus est <NOTE N="2799" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> . Cui successit
Egilbertus <NOTE N="2800" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> engilbertus 5. engelbertus B1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita deinceps,</HI>  egelbertus B2. 3. e. s. 5. 6.</NOTE> ; de cujus electionis occasione libet
altius parumper edicere.</P> <P COM="1193">10 <NOTE N="2801" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LIX.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn. In</HI>  C1. 6.  <HI REND="ITALIC">rubra legitur:</HI>  Item alia ratio notab.;  <HI REND="ITALIC">in</HI>  C3: de electione egilberti.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Cap. 10-14. desunt</HI> 
B5.</NOTE> . Tempore illo cum <NOTE N="2802" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> quo 5.</NOTE>  Gregorius, qui et
 <COL N="1194A"></COL> Hildebrand <NOTE N="2803" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> hildebranth 4.</NOTE> , Romani pontificatus jura disponeret,
hoc decretum antiquitus quidem promulgatum,
nunc autem innovatum est, ut videlicet omnes in
sacris ordinibus constituti, presbiteri <NOTE N="2804" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  scilicet et
diaconi, a cohabitationibus feminarum se ut decet
cohiberent <NOTE N="2805" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> distribuerent  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  abstinerent 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita</HI>  6 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <SUP>c</SUP> .
astinerent 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , aut ab <NOTE N="2806" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6.</NOTE>  officio cessarent <NOTE N="2807" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> vacarent 6.</NOTE> . Simul
etiam <NOTE N="2808" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> Similiter ne 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  ne quis cujuscumque ordinis, laicus
videlicet sive <NOTE N="2809" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  clericus, episcopatus, abbacias
seu alias quaslibet spiritualium donorum dignitates,
vel <NOTE N="2810" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  per se vel per <NOTE N="2811" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  interpositam personam,
emere sive <NOTE N="2812" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> vel 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>  vendere praesumeret; quodque <NOTE N="2813" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> quod 5. 6.</NOTE> 
si quis infringeret, honorem quemcumque haberet
amitteret. Ubi hoc verbum palam factum est, in
cordibus eorum qui non secundum Deum incedebant
magnam suscitavit invidiam. Propterea inter
 <COL N="1194B"></COL> regnum et sacerdocium partes exortae sunt, et hinc
inde permaximae inimicitiae <NOTE N="2814" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> invidiae 5. 6.</NOTE>  succreverunt <NOTE N="2815" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> succreverint 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . succurrerunt B1.</NOTE> , et
eo usque dissensionis hujus et inimicitiarum in invicem
fomes invaluit, ut si cui caesarianorum occurrisset
quispiam ecclesiasticorum, qui forsitan pro
amore patriae coelestis seculum reliquisset, carnem
macerasset, quemque aliqua <NOTE N="2816" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> alia C.</NOTE>  corporis molestia
attenuasset, sive qui, ut tunc moris erat, barbam
quasi in signum religionis enutrisset, quasi regii honoris
 <NOTE N="2817" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> h. r. C3.</NOTE>  proditores contumeliis afficiebant, insultanter
eos ecclesianos appellantes. Nullus enim tunc
in subrogandis pontificibus vel aliis ecclesiasticis
dignitatibus canonicae sanctionis ordo servabatur,
sed qui tantum regis <NOTE N="2818" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> regis—sibi  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  B2.</NOTE>  vel principis manum implesset
seu aliud qualecumque obsequium sibi placitum
 <COL N="1194C"></COL> inpendisset, regia praeficiebatur violentia ubi
voluisset. At vero ubi <NOTE N="2819" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE>  rex ejusque consentanei
principes non eo minus omittebant, sed vetitam
venditionem magis et <NOTE N="2820" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> ac 6.</NOTE>  magis instituebant, praefatus
papa non veritus sententia anathematis omnes
conclusit <NOTE N="2821" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> concludit 5. 6.</NOTE> , et quicumque voluisset in catholicorum
consortio numerari, faciebat sibi hujusmodi
verba conscribi:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Anathematizo omnem heresim Heinrici
dicti regis et omnium</HI> <NOTE N="2822" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">complicium</HI> <NOTE N="2823" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> complicum 5.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ejus et omnem
qui eum regio nomine vel</HI> <NOTE N="2824" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> et 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">honore</HI> <NOTE N="2825" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> v. h.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  B1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">veneratur,</HI> 
Heinricum inquam nominis <NOTE N="2826" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> h. n. 5. B4.</NOTE>  hujus quartum <NOTE N="2827" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1193" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1193"></COL> r. q. 6.</NOTE> 
 <COL N="1195A"></COL> regem. Quam excommunicationem ubi fama <NOTE N="2828" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5.</NOTE>  ad
aures imperatoris <NOTE N="2829" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> d. i. 5. 6.</NOTE>  detulit, aegre admodum ferens
et peccatum peccato superadjiciens, convocato suae
partis episcoporum abbatum et aliorum graduum
concilio, statuit, ut Gregorius <NOTE N="2830" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> n. e. g. 6.</NOTE>  nulli eorum deinceps
apostolicus esset, nec decreta ejus quisquam
reciperet. Et hoc facto, ipse <NOTE N="2831" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B4?</NOTE>  sub omni celeritate
Italiam adiit, Wicbertum <NOTE N="2832" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> wichbertum 5. et w. B1.</NOTE>  quendam <NOTE N="2833" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  Ravennae
civitatis episcopum in una civitatum <NOTE N="2834" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> civitate B4. C3.</NOTE>  Italiae <NOTE N="(485)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195C"></COL> Brixiae.</NOTE> 
pro Gregorio papam fecit ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an.</HI>  1080); quem et Clementem
nominavit. Porro si quando Gregorius
causa cujuslibet rei agendae Romam <NOTE N="2835" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> roma 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . romam f. ingressus  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  roma f. egressus 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . ingressus 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  fuisset
egressus, iste <NOTE N="2836" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> ille 4.</NOTE>  subintrabat; illo revertente, iste
fugiebat. Illi ecclesiastica <NOTE N="2837" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE> , major videlicet <NOTE N="2838" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE> 
pars, isti <NOTE N="2839" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> i. vero 6.</NOTE>  caesariana pars <NOTE N="2840" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6. B1.</NOTE>  praesidio erat. Sed
 <COL N="1195B"></COL> quid ad nos ista pertinent? pocius <NOTE N="2841" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> pocius—prosequamur  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  C6.</NOTE>  in sua loca
abeant <NOTE N="2842" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> habeant
B2. 3.</NOTE> . Nos autem propositi nostri seriem prosequamur.</P> <P COM="1195">11 <NOTE N="2843" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LX.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn.</HI></NOTE> . Per idem tempus fuit in civitate Batavia
 <NOTE N="2844" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> barama 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">post corr.</HI>  battavia 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . baramia 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . batana B1. 3. bathanya
B2. batava  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  batavia C1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(486)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1196" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1196C"></COL> Passau.</NOTE>  de optimatibus Bajoariae <NOTE N="2845" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> bajoriae 4. 5. B3. 4. bawoariae B2.</NOTE>  ex clero
quidam praepositus majoris ecclesiae et scholasticus
nomine Egilbertus <NOTE N="2846" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> engelbertus B1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">semper.</HI></NOTE> , qui vice quadam, cum episcopus
loci illius, sicut et aliarum civitatum episcopi,
ex praecepto Romani pontificis supra memoratum
decretum in ecclesia sua pronunciaret <NOTE N="2847" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> recitaret 6.</NOTE> , ausu temerario
illi in faciem restitit, palam dans cunctis
intelligere <NOTE N="2848" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> intelligere C1.</NOTE> , quoniam <NOTE N="2849" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> quam B1.</NOTE>  et ipse cum Heinricianis
vinculo teneretur anathematis. Constat enim <NOTE N="2850" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE> ,
testimonium <NOTE N="2851" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> testimonio 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  perhibente apostolo, de malefactoribus <NOTE N="2852" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> fautoribus 4.
factoribus 5.</NOTE> ,
quia facientes et consentientes una sunt
 <COL N="1195C"></COL> sententia plectendi  <CITN>(Rom. I, 32)</CITN> . Ille vero <NOTE N="2853" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>  consentit,
qui etsi rennuere non valeat, favendo tamen, quantum
in ipso est, malefacientis operibus communicat.
Dicebat autem imperatori licere, nec idcirco ecclesiae
 <NOTE N="2854" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> c. e. 6.</NOTE>  consorcium amittere <NOTE N="2855" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> c. non a. B1.</NOTE> , si non spiritualia
sed regalia sua gratis preciove cui voluerit inpendat.
Quae utique non sua, sed juxta Romanam consuetudinem
regalia beati Petri vel ecclesiae pociori jure
possunt appellari. Sed utinam qui ad ecclesiasticae
dignitatis culmen <NOTE N="2856" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6. honorem  <HI REND="ITALIC">superscr.</HI>  6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  venire desiderant, non ambiciose,
quod minime decet, se ingerant, neque artificiosi
colore commenti symoniacae hereseos sibi machinamenta
confingant <NOTE N="2857" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> configant
B2.</NOTE> , asserentes se non spiritualia
sed terrena terrenis acquirere, cum sicut tempore,
 <COL N="1196A"></COL> sic et in eorum mente primum sit animale,
deinde quod <NOTE N="2858" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B2.</NOTE>  spirituale, et non [tam <NOTE N="2859" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest in omnibus fere codicibus; nescio an in 4. et</HI>  B4.  <HI REND="ITALIC">legatur.</HI></NOTE> ] appetant
curam pastoralem quam honorem temporalem!
Multis itaque sermonibus pro <NOTE N="2860" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  hujusmodi ad invicem
collatis, cum vidisset <NOTE N="2861" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> videret 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  eum episcopus incorrigibiliter
symoniacae parti et nil penitus ecclesiasticae
assentire, jussit eum a communione ecclesiae
alienum existere, usque dum universali papae praesentatus,
unitati ecclesiae per ipsum meruerit sociari.
Proinde cum diutius intra se haesitasset, demum
voluntas <NOTE N="2862" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> ei v. 6.</NOTE>  ei Romam proficiscendi incidit,
verumptamen rege inconsulto ire illo noluit; a quo
rege, inquam <NOTE N="2863" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE> , accepta ad eum, quem superpositum
 <NOTE N="2864" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> superpositi 4. suppositum 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . subpositum B2.</NOTE>  papae diximus, mandata detulit, et ab universali
penitus declinavit. Et factum est, dum rediret
 <COL N="1196B"></COL> adimpletis negociis pro quibus a rege missus
fuerat, in redeundo audivit Uodonem, fideli dignum
memoria Treverensem <NOTE N="2865" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> treberensium
6.</NOTE>  archiepiscopum <NOTE N="2866" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> episcopum B2.</NOTE> , vita
decessisse, et ob hoc <NOTE N="2867" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  regem Treverim adivisse <NOTE N="2868" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> treberim advenisse 5. 6.</NOTE> ,
ut alium in locum <NOTE N="2869" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> loco 5.</NOTE>  ejus debuisset substituere. Et
hac <NOTE N="2870" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> Hec f. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  fama comperta, quam plurimum iter <NOTE N="2871" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> tunc 5.</NOTE> 
acceleravit, intra se cogitans, si forte eo maturius
potuisset <NOTE N="2872" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> posset 5.</NOTE>  pervenire, pro inpensa saepius regi
servitute hunc ei honorem posse succedere <NOTE N="2873" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> subsistere 6.</NOTE> ;
quod et <NOTE N="2874" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  factum est. Sed qualiter ad id ventum
fuerit <NOTE N="2875" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> est 5.</NOTE> , ignaros docebimus. Porro cum imperator
jussisset ut quem sibi placere cognoscerent
hunc episcopum eligerent, et clerus unum post unum
ex ipso eorum collegio <NOTE N="2876" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> consortio 4. 5. 6.</NOTE> , hoc utique honore dignissimos,
exhiberent, rex autem, quotquot neminassent,
 <COL N="1196C"></COL> nullum eorum <NOTE N="2877" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.
C6.</NOTE>  sibi placere dixisset
 <NOTE N="2878" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> dixit 5.</NOTE> —nullus enim eorum <NOTE N="2879" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  benivolentiam ejus
digna taxatione praevenerat,—jamque <NOTE N="2880" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> jam 6.</NOTE>  in eligendo
tribus diebus transactis <NOTE N="2881" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> exactis 6.</NOTE> , et quarto nichilominus
die iterum <NOTE N="2882" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6. B1.</NOTE>  ad idem congregatis omnibus:
tamquam a Deo missus—si tamen dici potest
a Deo dirigi via <NOTE N="2883" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> viam B1.</NOTE>  hominis qui culpa sui <NOTE N="2884" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> sua 5. 6.</NOTE> 
meruit <NOTE N="2885" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> meruerit B1. 2. 4.</NOTE>  ab <NOTE N="2886" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> ab ecclesia et ecclesie c. 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  ecclesiae communione suspendi—venit,
et facta oracione sua <NOTE N="2887" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE> , locutus est regi de
his quae habebat in mandatis. Quibus finitis dixit
rex:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quia</HI> <NOTE N="2888" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> O 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . quamdiu 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <SUP>c</SUP> . B2. 3. 4.
C. quoniam 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">jam diu in eligendo episcopo concordare
non possumus</HI> <NOTE N="2889" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> possimus 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">saltem in hunc conveniamus.</HI> 
Et consensit ei ex episcopis qui electionis <NOTE N="2890" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> c. e. 5 6. devotionis c. C.</NOTE>  causa
advenerant solus Theodericus <NOTE N="2891" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> theodricus 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  Virdunensis <NOTE N="2892" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1195"></COL> wirdunensis
B2.</NOTE> 
 <COL N="1197A"></COL> episcopus, qui cognomento Magnus vocabatur, et
pars aliqua <NOTE N="2893" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE>  populi Treverensis. Rex ergo <NOTE N="2894" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> igitur B2. vero 5. 6.</NOTE>  nil
moratus investivit eum, dans ei anulum et baculum
sub die octavo <NOTE N="2895" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE>  Idus Januarii anno <NOTE N="2896" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B2.</NOTE>  dominicae
incarnationis 1078 <NOTE N="(487)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197C"></COL> Annus 1079 intelligendus videtur, cum certe
anni 22, menses 8, dies 3, quos  <CITN>(c. 17)</CITN>  Egilberti regimini
attributos legimus, ab a. 1079 octavo Id. Jan.
ad Non. Sept. explentur. Antiquus Trevirorum mos
scribendi annum a 25 Martii inchoabat. V. disserationem
a. 1815 Treviris impressam s. t. Chronologisch-diplomatische
 <COL N="1198C"></COL> Bemerkungen uber die Zeitrechnung
der Trierer im Mittelalter.  <ED>WYTT.</ED>  Cf. etiam
Stenzel. I, p. 437 n. Stalin Hist. Wirtemb. I, p. 510.</NOTE> . Pontifices vero Herimannus
 <NOTE N="2897" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> hermannus 5. B1. C6. heremannus
B2.</NOTE>  Mettensis et Bibo <NOTE N="2898" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> bybo B2.</NOTE>  Tullensis et residuus
clerus et populus, quantum in ipsis erat, non assenserunt,
quoniam ipsi tam idoneas <NOTE N="2899" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> idoneos  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  idoneas C1.</NOTE>  personas exhibuerunt
 <NOTE N="2900" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> exhibuerant 5.</NOTE> ; resistere tamen regis voluntati non
potuerunt. Verumptamen clerus et populus <NOTE N="2901" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> et p.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  B1. 2.</NOTE>  multum
moleste ferentes irrogari <NOTE N="2902" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> tantum sibi i. v. 6.</NOTE>  sibi violentiam,
deprecabantur eos qui praesto erant episcopos, et
cum interminacione auctoritatis apostolicae interdixerunt,
ne ipsum consecrarent antistitem <NOTE N="2903" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> episcopum B4?</NOTE> ,
commonentes eos canonici illius decreti, quo praecipitur
 <COL N="1197B"></COL> ut nullus in episcopum nisi canonice electus
consecretur. Quocirca episcopis in sua redeuntibus,
Egilbertus benedictione non percepta remansit,
et erat cupiens <NOTE N="2904" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  consecrari, nec potuit ab
aliquo episcoporum ecclesiasticorum <NOTE N="2905" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> catholicorum 5. 6.</NOTE> , qui ingressum
ejus audisset <NOTE N="2906" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> audissent 4. 5. 6.</NOTE> , diebus quam plurimis
impetrare <NOTE N="(488)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1198" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1198C"></COL> Cf. Theoderici episcopi Vird. epistolam Egilberto
scriptam ex cod. Udalriceo ap. Hontheim I, p. 426.</NOTE> . Tribus <NOTE N="(489)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1198" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1198C"></COL> Sex dicere debebat.</NOTE>  igitur annis fere <NOTE N="2907" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE> 
transactis, cum res regi innotuisset, qui sub ipso
tempore Roma <NOTE N="2908" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> romam 5. B2. C.</NOTE>  rediens, multa <NOTE N="2909" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> multa—si ita sumus ex  <CITN>(infra c. 17.)</CITN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  B3,  <HI REND="ITALIC">tribus foliis amissis.</HI></NOTE>  ibi caede patrata
et papa Gregorio fugato, quo certe nichil in
 <NOTE N="2910" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6. certe d. i. n. c. f, omnium ora 6.</NOTE>  diebus illis <NOTE N="2911" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>  ( <HI REND="ITALIC">ap.</HI>  1084) celebriori fama ora
omnium adimplebat, secus Alpes moram <NOTE N="2912" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> moras B2.</NOTE>  faciebat,
directis epistolis <NOTE N="2913" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> epis 6.</NOTE>  ad supradictum Virdunensem
episcopum, qui ei summa familiaritate adhaerebat,
 <COL N="1197C"></COL> petivit <NOTE N="2914" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> petiit
quo 6.</NOTE> , quatinus Treverensem metropolitanum
 <NOTE N="2915" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> episcopum m. B1.</NOTE>  quantocius consecrare studeret. Quarum
epistolarum exemplar <NOTE N="2916" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>  hic inserere non videtur
 <NOTE N="2917" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> ab re v. 6.</NOTE>  ab re, quae habent hunc modum:</P> <P COM="1197">12 <NOTE N="2918" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LX.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn. In</HI>  C1. 6.  <HI REND="ITALIC">legitur rubra:</HI> 
Incipiunt litterae quas imperator Heinricus misit T.</NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Rex Heinricus Dei gratia Romanorum
imperator et</HI> <NOTE N="2919" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">augustus</HI> <NOTE N="2920" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> semper augustus B1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Theoderico episcopo
dilectionem nulli majorem. Inprimis te scire volumus,
quia nulli melius quam tibi confidimus, nec episcopum
Trajectensem fidei monitorem, sed ad</HI> <NOTE N="2921" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> ad hoc
honorem 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">honorem
regni tractandum tibi misisse cooperatorem. Deinde
ad singula quae mandasti negocia singula damus responsa,
sed brevissima, quia infinita tibi reservamus
 <COL N="1198A"></COL> ore ad os dicenda. Siquidem hoc quod in margine
epistolae tuae de Romano negocio nobis mandasti, inprimis
dicimus tibi</HI> <NOTE N="2922" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> t d. B1.</NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Romam in die sancti Benedicti
intravimus; qualiter</HI> <NOTE N="2923" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> qualiter—simus  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">autem a Romanis recepti
simus</HI> <NOTE N="2924" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> sumus 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">qualiter cum Romanis steterimus,
qualiter a Romanis recesserimus, ab aliis multis te
audisse credimus, tum etiam litteris nostris tibi indicavimus</HI> <NOTE N="2925" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> indicamus B1. 2. 4. C.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">quas te nondum vidisse putamus</HI> <NOTE N="2926" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> credimus 5. 6.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">sed et mallemus alio quam nostro ore te</HI> <NOTE N="2927" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">rescisse
quae nobis fecit Dominus. Incredibile enim videtur,
quod verissimum probatur, quod factum</HI> <NOTE N="2928" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">est in
Roma</HI> <NOTE N="2929" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> est rome 6. urbe r. B4?</NOTE> ;  <HI REND="ITALIC">ut ita dicam, cum decem hominibus in
nobis</HI> <NOTE N="2930" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> in nobis  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">operatus est Dominus, quod</HI> <NOTE N="2931" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> quae C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">antecessores
nostri si fecissent cum decem milibus, miraculum
esset omnibus. Nam cum in Theutonicas partes, de
 <COL N="1198B"></COL> acquirenda Roma jam</HI> <NOTE N="2932" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">desperantes, redire vellemus,
ecce Romani missis legatis ut Romam intraremus
rogaverunt, seque</HI> <NOTE N="2933" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> se quoque 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">in omnibus nobis obedituros
promiserunt; quod et fecerunt. Summo namque
gaudio nos intrantes receperunt</HI> <NOTE N="2934" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> susceperunt 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">summo studio
secum manentes adjuverunt, summo triumpho et fide
ab eis recedentes prosecuti sunt nos</HI> <NOTE N="2935" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6. B1.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">in tantum
ut</HI> <NOTE N="2936" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">in Domino fiducialiter dicamus quia tota Roma
in manu nostra</HI> <NOTE N="2937" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> n. manu C3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">est, excepto illo castello</HI> <NOTE N="2938" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">in quo inclusus est</HI> <NOTE N="2939" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. reclusus habitat h. 6. conclusus C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Hildebrant</HI> <NOTE N="2940" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> hildebranth 4.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">scilicet in
domo Crescentii. Quem Hildebrandum legali omnium
cardinalium ac totius populi Romani</HI> <NOTE N="2941" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">judicio scias
abjectum, et electum papam</HI> <NOTE N="2942" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> n. p. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nostrum Clementem
in sede apostolica sublimatum omnium Romanorum
acclamatione, nosque a papa Clemente ordinatum et</HI> 
 <COL N="1198C"></COL> <NOTE N="2943" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> et in B2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">consensu omnium Romanorum consecratum in die
sancto</HI> <NOTE N="2944" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> sancte 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">paschae in</HI> <NOTE N="2945" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> . B1. 2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">imperatorem totius populi
Romani exultatione</HI> <NOTE N="2946" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> in e. C.</NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">His ita</HI> <NOTE N="2947" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> itaque 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> .
B1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">factis benedictione
Dei et sancti Petri omnium gaudio a Roma recessimus,
et quanto citius</HI> <NOTE N="2948" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> quantocius 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . B1. 2. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">possumus</HI> <NOTE N="2949" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> possimus B2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ad has
partes</HI> <NOTE N="2950" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> <SUP>b</SUP> . prop. partes 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">properamus</HI> <NOTE N="2951" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> properantes B2.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et in via reditus invenit
nos tuus nuntius. Gaudeant qui velint</HI> <NOTE N="2952" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> gaude autem C6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">doleant
qui velint, nos Deo propicio assumus. Domnus ille
quid agat, scire non curamus, sed quod tu monuisti</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2953" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> innotuisti C6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">libenter ne nobis dampnum</HI> <NOTE N="2954" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> damnum n. f. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">faciat providebimus.
De Saxonibus vero, de Salzburgense</HI> <NOTE N="2955" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1197" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1197"></COL> Salebergensi 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . Saleburgensi 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .
Saleburgense 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">archiepiscopo,
 <COL N="1199A"></COL> de comite Adalberto, et de aliis ad nos
redire volentibus id tibi respondemus, quia consiliis
tuis libenter acquiescimus, ut tantummodo pax vera</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2956" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fiat in nostris temporibus</HI> <NOTE N="2957" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> partibus C6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">videlicet ut fideles
sint, cum ad nos redierint. Tu autem si non gravaris
facere quod volumus, Augustam ad nos venire post
festum apostolorum Petri et Pauli rogamus</HI> <NOTE N="2958" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> te r. 6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia,</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2959" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> q. erimus d. f. i. f. e. r. 5.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Deo favente, in festivitate</HI> <NOTE N="2960" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> festo
5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">eorum Radisponae</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2961" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> ratisponae B2. r. villa 5.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">erimus. Studeas ergo ad nos venire, ut tuo nos
adventu possis</HI> <NOTE N="2962" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> t. a. p. nos 5. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">laetificare. Insuper mandat tibi</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2963" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> t. m. 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">apostolicus Clemens et imperator</HI> <NOTE N="2964" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> h. i. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Heinricus,
ut sicut nos diligas</HI> <NOTE N="2965" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> diligas
 <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  diligis 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . diligis 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita archiepiscopum Treverensem
velociter consecrare properes</HI> <NOTE N="2966" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> festines 5. 6.</NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vale</HI> <NOTE N="2967" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> valete 5.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="1199">13. <NOTE N="2968" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LXII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn.</HI></NOTE>  Has igitur epistolas <NOTE N="2969" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> litteras 6.</NOTE>  cum praefatus
Theodericus acceptas legisset, noluit <NOTE N="2970" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> voluit 5. C.</NOTE>  quidem
 <COL N="1199B"></COL> quod petebatur libenter adimplere, sed attonitus rerum
magnitudine, non posuit <NOTE N="2971" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> non potuit 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . 6. B3. n. posuit in corde s. non credere B1.</NOTE>  in corde suo credere,
ita se omnia habere sicut scriptura referente
 <NOTE N="2972" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> ref. s. 5.</NOTE>  cognoverat. Sed et recordatus, quod a clero
Treverensi ne id faceret apostolica auctoritate sibi
interdictum fuisset, ne forte adversus <NOTE N="2973" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> adversum
5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  eum exinde
potuissent quandoque idoneae <NOTE N="2974" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> a. ydonee 5.</NOTE>  accusationes
consurgere, congruum duxit super hoc litteras mittere
Romano pontifici, in quibus et meminit depulsionis
ab episcopatu Herimanni <NOTE N="2975" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> heremanni B2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita deinceps;</HI>  hermanni 5. C.</NOTE>  supradicti Mettensis
 <NOTE N="2976" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> m. episcopi 4. metensis
C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">saepius.</HI></NOTE>  ac sibi injunctae reconciliationis, ut videlicet
ipsius interventione Herimannus loco suo restitueretur;
quod, licet satis laboraverit, non tamen
tunc sed postea obtinere potuit <NOTE N="2977" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> obtinuit 6.</NOTE> . Litterarum autem
 <NOTE N="2978" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  quas mittebat hic erat modus <NOTE N="2979" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> C1. 6.  <HI REND="ITALIC">add. rubram:</HI>  Littere Theoderici Virdunensis episcopi
quas misit Gregorio pape.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(490)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199C"></COL> Hanc epistolam pluribus annis ante Heinrici
litteras scriptam esse inde patet, quod dicit. per
 <COL N="1200C"></COL> biennium fere Ecclesiam Treverensem esse viduam.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="1199"><COL N="1199C"></COL> (An. 1080?)  <HI REND="ITALIC">Gregorio summo pontifici karissimo
domino reverentissimo</HI> <NOTE N="2980" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> ac r. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">patri Theodericus Virdunensis
episcopus qualiscumque tamen suus, dilectionem
quam patri filius, subjectionem quam praelato
subditus, servitutem quam domino servus. Posse tibi
obedire maxima est</HI> <NOTE N="2981" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> mihi e. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">michi jocunditas, posse servire
non parva hilaritas; in quo enim venerabor te, in
eo beatum Petrum</HI> <NOTE N="2982" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> p. apostolum C6.</NOTE> ;  <HI REND="ITALIC">in quo obediendo serviendo te
michi conciliabo</HI> <NOTE N="2983" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> reconciliabo
C6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">in eo beatum apostolum</HI> <NOTE N="2984" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> b. petrum a. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . C.</NOTE> .
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Monitus a te suscepi confratrem meum Mettensem ut
te ipsum, attendens illud dominicum: «Qui vos recipit,
me recipit</HI>   <CITN>(Matth. X, 40)</CITN> »,  <HI REND="ITALIC">causam ejus meam
 <COL N="1200A"></COL> feci, negocium</HI> <NOTE N="2985" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> n. ejus 6 <SUP>d</SUP> . ejus C1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">in marg. add. et ita</HI>  C3  <HI REND="ITALIC">sqq.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">meum existimavi, eadem nobis
adversitas</HI> <NOTE N="2986" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> prosperitas e. f.
adversitas 6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">eadem fuit prosperitas. Ad hoc me invitavit
mutua fraternitas, debita caritas, sed praecipue
jussio tua, benivolentia tua et habita in me fiducia.
Praeterea</HI> <NOTE N="2987" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> Propterea 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Treverensis ecclesia cum gravi dolore
pedibus paternis</HI> <NOTE N="2988" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> vestris 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">advolvitur</HI> <NOTE N="2989" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> provolvitur 6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">filia dominum
pulsat, inconsolabile</HI> <NOTE N="2990" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> p. in consolatione 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">sui detrimentum his</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2991" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> in hiis 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">temporibus me mediante deplorat. Vidua per</HI> <NOTE N="2992" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. fere biennio 6.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">biennium fere quanta passa est et patitur! quantum
afflicta est et affligitur! Foris pugnae</HI> <NOTE N="2993" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">intus timores.
Elegit virum de plebe dignum sacerdotem, idoneum
patrem, communi assensu, teste conscientia
mea coram Deo et coram te, quod nichil symoniacum
contra ejus ecclesiasticum intercurrerit, quod nichil
symoniacum etiam peticione remota intervenerit. Consecrationem
 <COL N="1200B"></COL> ejus miramur differri</HI> <NOTE N="2994" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> differri—miramur  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">dilationem</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2995" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> desolationem
5 <SUP>a</SUP> <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tam gravem miramur potuisse tibi inculcari</HI> <NOTE N="2996" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> intorculari C.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">illud maxime, quod pateris hac desolatione nos adeo
gravari. Gravissimum onus est michi, solum</HI> <NOTE N="2997" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">esse
in medio nationis pravae et</HI> <NOTE N="2998" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> atque 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">perversae; solum, patre</HI> 
 <NOTE N="2999" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> R.  <HI REND="ITALIC">post add. 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . et ita</HI>  6 <SUP>b</SUP> . patre ex 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et fratre illo expulso, alio non consecrato. Si
ecclesiam, si statum christianitatis curas</HI> <NOTE N="3000" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> cures 5.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">locum
nostrum respicias, et cum vita</HI> <NOTE N="3001" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> et cura p. 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">patris in omnibus
spectata ordinacionem mereatur, Mettensem</HI> <NOTE N="3002" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  5. B1. 2. 3. mettense 6. metensem  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  metense C1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita</HI> 
C3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">sqq.</HI>  metensem—remoretur  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et
me tuo exaudito, nullius detractione ulterius remoretur</HI> <NOTE N="3003" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> rememoretur 6. demoretur B1.</NOTE> .
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Persolvet</HI> <NOTE N="3004" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> persolvit 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tibi quod patri filius, quod
praelato subditus.</HI>  Deinde quibusdam interpositis,
in fine ita concludit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quomodo rex sit</HI> <NOTE N="3005" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tecum et
tu</HI> <NOTE N="3006" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> tui 6 <SUP>c</SUP></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">cum rege, modo</HI> <NOTE N="3007" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">michi rescribas tuo.</HI></P> <P COM="1200"><COL N="1200C"></COL> 14 <NOTE N="3008" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LXIII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn.</HI></NOTE> . ( <HI REND="ITALIC">An.</HI>  1084) Denique his quae decursa sunt
Romam directis, appropinquante tempore <NOTE N="3009" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> termino 5. 6.</NOTE>  quo
se rex venturum per epistolam suprascriptam ipsi
mandaverat, sicut jussus fuerat <NOTE N="3010" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> i. ei f. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , venire ei obviam
parabat, veniensque Mogontiam <NOTE N="3011" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> in m. B2.</NOTE> , ibi forte
 <NOTE N="3012" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B4?</NOTE>  complures episcoporum in occursum regis euntium
repperit; ad quos facta oracione, quoniam confratres
sui, suffraganei videlicet ecclesiae <NOTE N="3013" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C. tr. ec. 5.</NOTE>  Treverensis,
supra nominati episcopi Herimannus Mettensis
et Bibo <NOTE N="3014" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> bybo B2. et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  Tullensis, ob invidiam regis metropolitani
sui consecrationi noluissent interesse, petivit ex
 <NOTE N="3015" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> ab 5. 6.</NOTE>  ipsis causa karitatis sibi <NOTE N="3016" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> s. eos 6.</NOTE>  cooperatores fieri, et
obtinuit. Itaque <NOTE N="3017" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> Ita 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  assumptis secum <NOTE N="3018" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1199" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1199"></COL> s. his 6.</NOTE>  qui plus ceteris
 <COL N="1201A"></COL> erga ipsum benigni <NOTE N="3019" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> b. esse 6.</NOTE>  videbantur, conivente <NOTE N="3020" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> connivente archipresulem B1. 4. annuente—archipresule C. convenit e. s. archipraesulem
4. 5. 6.</NOTE> 
ejusdem sedis archipraesule, Egilbertum <NOTE N="3021" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> et e. 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .  <SUP>d</SUP> .</NOTE>  consecravit
 <NOTE N="3022" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> c. eum 4.</NOTE>  episcopum. Porro cum fuisset ordinatus, paucis interjectis
diebus, Treverim venit, et coepit cum his
qui, ut ita dicam, ipsum <NOTE N="3023" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> his, ut i. d. qui eum 4.</NOTE>  noluerunt <NOTE N="3024" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> r. n. 6.</NOTE>  regnare
super se, tyrannico more agere, ut deinceps ab
ejus impugnatione desisterent; majoribus, quibus
plus nocere non potuit, ex rege timorem incutere;
invalidae vero plebis, quae se adversus ipsum <NOTE N="3025" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> eum
B. 4. C.</NOTE> 
defendere non potuit, bona quacumque occasione
diripere. Tunc hii qui plus ceteris ei ausi <NOTE N="3026" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> a. s. ei r. 6.</NOTE>  sunt
resistere, dixerunt:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quoniam ad hunc</HI> <NOTE N="3027" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> adhuc 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">pontificatus
honorem</HI> <NOTE N="3028" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> ordinem 5. 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et tunc et nunc ingratis</HI> <NOTE N="3029" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> ingratus B2. 4. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nobis
accessisti, sed et quia ab homine excommunicato et
laico episcopalia suscepisti, episcopalia inquam anulum
 <COL N="1201B"></COL> et baculum, praesertim cum</HI> <NOTE N="3030" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">in canonibus decretis</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3031" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> et d. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">laicis quantumvis religiosis nulla</HI> <NOTE N="3032" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> et 5.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6. de e. r. a. d. nulla 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">de ecclesiasticis
rebus aliquid</HI> <NOTE N="3033" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> aliqua B2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">disponendi sit tributa facultas,
idcirco non poteris episcopari</HI> <NOTE N="3034" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> episcopare B1. 2. C.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">nec nos
tibi communicare. At vero si insuper debes in gradu</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3035" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> gradum 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">suscepti honoris consistere</HI> <NOTE N="3036" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> persistere 6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">oportet te
Gregorio catholicae ecclesiae</HI> <NOTE N="3037" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> apostolicae C3. 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">summo pontifici obsequi
et obedire, et heretico</HI> <NOTE N="3038" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> heretico illi—abrenunciare  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> . 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">illi superposito penitus
abrenunciare, heretico inquam juxta illud quod
beatus</HI> <NOTE N="3039" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Gelasius papa et martyr in epistola quadam,
universis orientalibus episcopis directa, de
hujusmodi superpositis scribens ait: «Quid ergo
facimus de</HI> <NOTE N="3040" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> de tot tantisque 6. de tantis— <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  40. jus libere transirent  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . folio deficiente
quod nunc codici Vaticano Christ No. 1283. f. 70. insertum esse supra dixi.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tantis totque civitatibus, ex quibus
catholici pontifices rejecti sunt? si catholici subrogati
sunt</HI> <NOTE N="3041" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B4? sunt s. sunt
5 <SUP>a</SUP> <SUP>b</SUP>  (cur—qui subrogati  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .). subrogati  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> . sunt subr. 6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">cur catholici sunt rejecti</HI> <NOTE N="3042" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> r. s. B2.</NOTE> ?  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sed evidenter
 <COL N="1201C"></COL> apparet quia</HI> <NOTE N="3043" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">cum catholici sunt rejecti, non
catholici fuerunt qui subrogati sunt</HI> <NOTE N="3044" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> sunt subr. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Restat</HI> <NOTE N="3045" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> Restat—successerunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt hoc loco</HI>  6.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">igitur ut</HI> <NOTE N="3046" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> cum C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">non sint catholici sed heretici quicumque
successerunt.» Item: «Quis non videat, illos
esse catholicos et ab omni heretica peste prorsus alienos,
qui a propriis urbibus detrusi</HI> <NOTE N="3047" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> extrusi 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et in exiliis
sunt redacti, et eos qui superstitibus catholicis successores
fieri ausi sunt, catholicos omnino non esse</HI> <NOTE N="3048" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> Restat igitur quod non—successerunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">hoc loco add.</HI>  6.</NOTE> .
 <HI REND="ITALIC">His</HI> <NOTE N="3049" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1. has C3. 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">adde et illos</HI> <NOTE N="3050" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> eos 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">qui se prius talium communioni
junxerunt.</HI> » Quo contra Egilbertus respondit,
velle se prius vitam dare, quam illi qui eum ad
hunc honorem provexisset <NOTE N="3051" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> provexit B 2.</NOTE>  infidelis existere.
 <COL N="1202A"></COL> numquam velle Gregorio obedire, quamdiu ipse <NOTE N="3052" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> 
nollet amicitiam regis inire <NOTE N="3053" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> preire 5. 6.</NOTE> . Interea dum haec
et his similia inter se contendentes tractarent, appropinquabat
jejunium quattuor temporum, quo consuetudo
est ecclesiae, promoveri eos in ordinem
clericatus qui sunt promovendi <NOTE N="3054" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> movendi B1. 2.</NOTE> ; et hoc <NOTE N="3055" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  iste
omni nisu <NOTE N="3056" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> visu 6 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  affectabat facere, non amore justiciae,
sed ut potuisset majorum quempiam sibi advincire <NOTE N="3057" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> advincere 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . advi. . . . . 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> ,
ut videlicet ab ipso consecrati postea ipsi
essent obnoxii, et quomodo suam ab ordine suspensionem,
ita pertimescerent ejus ab episcopatu depositionem.
Cujus intentionem cum rescissent, dixerunt:
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Quia pallium</HI> <NOTE N="3058" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> paululum 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quod</HI> <NOTE N="3059" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">a Romana
ecclesia metropoli nostrae debetur, nondum es adeptus,
impositionem manus a te percipere</HI> <NOTE N="3060" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> recipere 5. suscipere 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nolumus,
 <COL N="1202B"></COL> maxime cum in canonibus decretum sit</HI> <NOTE N="3061" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> est 5.</NOTE> : « <HI REND="ITALIC">Si quis
episcopus</HI> <NOTE N="3062" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">metropolitanus sine pallio consecrare
praesumpserit, et consecrator et consecratus gravi
ordinis sui periculo subjacebit.» Quod utique si debes
acquirere, necessarium</HI> <NOTE N="3063" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> n. h.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">habes erga papam</HI> <NOTE N="3064" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> pape—Gregorio B2.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">quem adeo despicis, Gregorium te</HI> <NOTE N="3065" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> te convenit 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">humiliare, ut
merearis accipere.</HI>  Quid <NOTE N="3066" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> Quid
multa  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4. 5. 6.</NOTE>  multa? Expositis ei <NOTE N="3067" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
idoneis causis pro quibus non debuerit <NOTE N="3068" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> deberet 4.</NOTE>  ordines
facere <NOTE N="3069" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> ministrare 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , abstinuit, et paucis diebus interpositis,
quendam <NOTE N="*" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203A"></COL> q. subditorum suorum nomine Theodericum
virum probum scolasticum monachum B 4 C.</NOTE>  consectaneum suum nomine Theodericum,
arte nigromanticum <NOTE N="3070" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> nichromaticum 6 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> . nichromanticum
6 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>d</SUP> . B2.</NOTE> , professione monachum,
scientia litterarum valde praeditum, misit
quaesitum Clementem <NOTE N="3071" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> s. c. 4.</NOTE>  suum apostolicum <NOTE N="3072" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> papam suum B1.</NOTE> ,
et <NOTE N="3073" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> ut 4. C?</NOTE>  inventum transmittere <NOTE N="3074" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> s. tr. 6. transmiteret e. 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .
transmitti 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  sibi expeteret <NOTE N="3075" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> peteret 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> 
pallium. At ille Clemens inquam <NOTE N="3076" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6.</NOTE>  gavisus quod
 <COL N="1202C"></COL> aliquis <NOTE N="3077" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> aliquid 6 <SUP>b</SUP> . ipsum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  ipsum pro accipienda benedictione respiceret,
quod petebat transmisit, cum litteris docentibus
 <NOTE N="3078" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> dicentibus C.</NOTE>  quibus temporibus hoc foret <NOTE N="3079" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> f. h. 4.</NOTE>  usurus;
quas quia auctor <NOTE N="3080" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> auctoritas auctor 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  non roborat, magis vero
infirmat—hereticorum enim <NOTE N="3081" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> vero 5. et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  et excommunicatorum
decreta fidelis quisque non recipit—, idcirco
commendare <NOTE N="3082" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> m. c. 6.</NOTE>  memoriae non curavimus <NOTE N="(491)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201C"></COL> Neque alibi exstant.</NOTE> .
Hic <NOTE N="3083" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LXIV.  <HI REND="ITALIC">inc. Leibn.</HI></NOTE>  autem quem jam nominavimus <NOTE N="3084" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">e corr.</HI>  C1.</NOTE>  Theodericus
de saepe dicto <NOTE N="3085" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B2.</NOTE>  Gregorio papa libros duos
edidit <NOTE N="(492)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1202" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1202C"></COL> Hontheim et Wyttenbach putant eum esse
 <COL N="1203C"></COL> librum, quem Henrico Sigebertus tribuit, de SS.
eccl., c. 160.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Henricus,</HI>  inquit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ex scholastico Treverensi
episcopus Vercellensis scripsit librum sub persona
Theoderici Virdunensis episcopi ad Hildebrandum
sive Gregorium papam de discordia regni et
sacerdotii.</HI>  Sed addit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Non eum increpans, sed ut seniorem
 <COL N="1204C"></COL> obsecrans et patrem, et amicabili inductione
quasi affectu dolentis suggerens ei omnia quae contra
jus legum et fas religionis eum fecisse et dixisse divulgabat loquax fama.</HI>  Neque liber a Martenio editus
cum his dictis convenit. Cf. Stenzel. l, p. 510, n.</NOTE> , in quibus mendaciis <NOTE N="3086" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> multis m. 5. 6.</NOTE>  multis conpilatis,
quae non ipso melius concinnare <NOTE N="3087" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1201"></COL> continuare 5.</NOTE>  quis novit,
Gregorium infamem fecit, regis vero et sui papae


 <COL N="1203A"></COL> innocentiam et sanctitatem commendavit. Pro quibus
editis iste de quo loquimur Egilbertus <NOTE N="3088" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> engilbertus B4.</NOTE> 
abbaciam sancti Martini <NOTE N="3089" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">dees</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> . sanctae Mariae 4. 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  super litus Mosellae,
defuncto beatae memoriae Sigiberto <NOTE N="3090" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> sigeberto 6. sigiberno B2. C. sigeberno
B4.</NOTE>  abbate,
eadem <NOTE N="3091" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> eodem 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  die illi retributionem <NOTE N="3092" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> regendam B4. C.</NOTE>  dedit; <NOTE N="**" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203A"></COL> B 4. C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita pergunt:</HI>  quam ipse felix abbas
quantum potuit rexit, et ecclesiam ipsam reparavit.
 <COL N="1203B"></COL> Nam ipsa—sufficiens; sed peccatis
exigentibus ejus temporibus ita est destituta,
quod monachi qui ibi Deo serviebant, nisi  <HI REND="ITALIC">etc.</HI></NOTE>  quo
utique malo si majus non fecisset, ad perpetuam
sui <NOTE N="3093" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> sibi 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  dampnationem sufficere potuisset. Nam ipsa
abbacia prius quidem <NOTE N="3094" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  erat admodum in rebus
sufficiens, at nunc ab <NOTE N="3095" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> adeo est ab hoc adn. 5.</NOTE>  hoc est adeo adnichilata,
ut monachi quoque qui divinis ibidem erant <NOTE N="3096" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> m. e. 6.</NOTE> 
mancipati serviciis, nisi aliunde conquirerent, nec
necessaria vitae haberent.</P> <P COM="1203"><COL N="1203B"></COL> 15. Est <NOTE N="3097" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">pergit</HI>  B5.</NOTE>  et aliud quiddam <NOTE N="3098" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> quoddam 5. 6.</NOTE>  gestorum
ejusdem <NOTE N="3099" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> eg. e. 5.</NOTE>  Egilberti, quod <NOTE N="*" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1204" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1204B"></COL> quod successoribus nostris volumus narrare.
B 4. 5. C.</NOTE>  pro facti similitudine
istic libet inserere <NOTE N="3100" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> inferre 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . B1. 2.</NOTE> . In monasterio puellarum
Horrei defuncta Imiza <NOTE N="3101" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> uniza 4. imaza
B2.</NOTE> , summae strennuitatis
ancilia Dei, matre coenobii, renitentibus <NOTE N="3102" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> renitentibus—famulantibus  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  C.</NOTE>  omnibus
ibi loci <NOTE N="3103" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  Deo famulantibus, praeposuit quandam
neptem suam <NOTE N="3104" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6. q. n. s. preposuit f. sui filiam 6.</NOTE>  fratris filiam nomine Liucardam
 <NOTE N="3105" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> liutgardem 4. lugardam B 1. liuchardam B 2. liugardam B 4.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="**" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1204" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1204B"></COL> B 3. 4. C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">pergunt:</HI>  L. corpore quidem valde
juvenculam et speciosam et secundum suam
etatem litteris eruditam, moribus honestam.
De qua  <HI REND="ITALIC">etc.</HI></NOTE> —quod cum pace salvo honore
professionis sanctimoniae dixerim; Deus scit <NOTE N="3106" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> quia s. 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . qui s. 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> 
quia non mentior—arte magam <NOTE N="3107" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> magicam 5.</NOTE> , veneficam,
incantatricem, blasphemam <NOTE N="3108" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> et bl. 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> . De qua cum episcopus
modis omnibus <NOTE N="3109" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1. 2. o. m.  <HI REND="ITALIC">s</HI>  B4. 5. C.</NOTE>  niteretur ut ibi eam
 <COL N="1203C"></COL> praeficeret, sanctimonialibus omnibus pusillis et <NOTE N="3110" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> cum 6.</NOTE> 
majoribus sine cessatione tam die quam nocte Deum
et sanctam ejus <NOTE N="3111" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> g. e. 5. 6. s. dei g. e. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  genitricem cui serviunt ne hoc
fieret orantibus, cuidam ex earum collegio, quae ceteris
frequentior oracioni incumbebat, inter verba
oracionis, ut divinae erat voluntatis, obdormienti,
talis ostensa est <NOTE N="3112" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> est o. B4. 5.</NOTE>  visio. Vidit sanctam Dei genitricem
 <NOTE N="3113" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> g. Mariam 6.</NOTE>  in medio angelorum <NOTE N="3114" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> sanctorum a. B 1.</NOTE>  stantem et
beatas virgines Irminam <NOTE N="3115" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> hiriminam 4.</NOTE> , Modestam, Anastasiam,
quae in diebus suis ipsi loco praeerant <NOTE N="3116" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> prefuerant 6.</NOTE> , coram
ea <NOTE N="3117" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> ei 6 <SUP>b</SUP> . ea  <HI REND="ITALIC">e corr.</HI>  C 1.</NOTE>  consistentes et vultus quasi moestos
 <COL N="1204A"></COL> exhibentes, et sanctam Dei matrem ita <NOTE N="3118" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> . m. sic all. 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  se alloquentem:
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Ausculta,</HI>  inquid <NOTE N="3119" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> f. inquit 6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">filia, cum</HI> <NOTE N="3120" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> cras cum C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">illuxerit
dies,</HI> —erat <NOTE N="3121" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> e. e.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5. 6.</NOTE>  enim hora matutina,— <HI REND="ITALIC">indica
sororibus tuis ex me, quia peccatis vestris exigentibus</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3122" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">decrevit Deus, ut ipsa, de qua petitis absolvi,
flagelli vobis loco proveniat, et tamdiu maneat</HI> <NOTE N="3123" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> manet 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  maneat 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">quousque pro afflictionibus ab</HI> <NOTE N="3124" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> vobis ab ea 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ipsa vobis irrogandis
de</HI> <NOTE N="3125" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">diuturnitate</HI> <NOTE N="3126" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> de d.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  6. diurnitate C3.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  diuturnitate B 2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">vitae ipsius vos pigeat.
Verumptamen noveritis, noveritis, ipsam</HI> <NOTE N="3127" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> eam 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ex praelatione
iram Dei in se provocare, vobis vero</HI> <NOTE N="3128" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">non
plus officere, nisi quod super destitucione hujus</HI> <NOTE N="3129" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 1. l. n. h. B2. h. vestri l. C.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">loci nostri videbimini sufferendo laborare.</HI>  Itaque
cum fuisset intronizata, coepit <NOTE N="***" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1204" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1204B"></COL> B. 4. 5. C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita pergunt:</HI>  coepit Deo servire,
sorores ecclesiae procurare, et rexit locum
illum annis usque ad tempora domni archiepiscopi
Adelberonis, qui primo Metensis primicerius,
 <COL N="1204C"></COL> postea Trevirorum [fuit  <HI REND="ITALIC">post add.</HI> 
C 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita</HI>  C. 3  <HI REND="ITALIC">sqq.</HI> ] archiepiscopus et Romanae
sedis legatus. Hujus [Cujus C.] temporibus
abbatissa Liugardis [liutcardis C 3.]
felicis memoriae obiit, et ante ecclesiam
[e. ipsam C.] in pace quiescit.</NOTE>  de <NOTE N="3130" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  bonis ecclesiae
juxta illud libri Machabeorum diabolum <NOTE N="3131" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> diabolicum 6. dyabolicum 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> . diabolicam magiam 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  magnum
exercere  <CITN>(I Macch. I, 38)</CITN> , et ut veram fatear
 <COL N="1204B"></COL> <NOTE N="3132" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> fuerat 5.</NOTE> , licet inpudenter <NOTE N="3133" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> inprudenter B1.</NOTE>  loquar, alia concubitoribus
suis distribuere, alia vendere, postremo, ut
breviter concludam, paucis ecclesiae derelictis, omnia
in usus suos convertere, ut posses liquido perpendere
veridicam Dei genitricis supradictam sententiam
 <NOTE N="3134" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> e. s.
5. 6.</NOTE>  existere, ipsam ex praelatione iram Dei
in se provocare.</P> <P COM="1204"><COL N="1204C"></COL> 16. Denique <NOTE N="3135" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> Deinde C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quae sequuntur</HI> —et similibus perseveraret  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  B5.</NOTE>  aliquantis transactis annis <NOTE N="3136" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> ,
Egilbertus coepit se <NOTE N="3136" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  satis admodum officio
dignum exhibere <NOTE N="3137" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> d. gerere
45 exhibere 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> , nisi solum quod <NOTE N="3138" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  ab <NOTE N="3139" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1. C6.</NOTE> 
excommunicatorum, regis videlicet et Clementis, se
noluit communione sequestrare. Propter quod <NOTE N="3140" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
Bruno <NOTE N="3141" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> et b. 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , qui ei in episcopatu proximo <NOTE N="3142" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1203" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1203"></COL> proximus 5. 6.</NOTE>  loco
 <COL N="1205A"></COL> successit, omnes quos ille ordinavit, iste ab officio
suspendit, nec remotos ad pristinum gradum admisit,
nisi qui se legitimo Romanae <NOTE N="3143" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> romano 5 <SUP>a</SUP>   <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  ecclesiae
pontifici obediturum super sanctum <NOTE N="3144" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6.</NOTE>  evangelium
fidem fecit. Complura memoria <NOTE N="3145" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> memoriae B2. C.</NOTE>  digna de hujus
Egilberti probis actibus <NOTE N="3146" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> rebus C3. 4.</NOTE> , quae per ipsum vel sub
ipsius temporibus gesta sunt, seniorum relatione
ad nostram noticiam devenerunt <NOTE N="3147" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> pervenerunt
6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> , quorum aliqua,
siquidem <NOTE N="3148" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  vel aliquam ejus memoriam cum pace
ecclesiae <NOTE N="3149" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> e. p. 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  fieri liceat in benedictione, curabimus
 <NOTE N="3150" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> posteritati  <HI REND="ITALIC">alia manu add.</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  insinuare. Quaedam <NOTE N="3151" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LXV.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn.</HI></NOTE>  praepotens <NOTE N="3152" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> m. p. 6.</NOTE>  matrona
comitissa <NOTE N="(493)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205C"></COL> Adelheidis sive Adela.</NOTE>  de castello <NOTE N="3153" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> cometissa de castaello B2.</NOTE>  quod Aralunae <NOTE N="(494)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205C"></COL> Arlon.</NOTE> 
dicitur, mater videlicet comitum Walramni <NOTE N="3154" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> walrammi B1. waleranni 4. 6.</NOTE> 
et Folconis <NOTE N="3155" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> fulconis 6 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> , marito suo <NOTE N="3156" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI> 
4.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(495)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205C"></COL> Walrammo; cf. diplomata Eberhardi a.
 <COL N="1206C"></COL> 1052 data apud Hontheim Hist. I, p. 352, 354.</NOTE>  defuncto,
astipulantibus filiis <NOTE N="3157" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> f. suis et filiabus 6.</NOTE>  et filiabus suis, bona proprietatis
 <COL N="1205B"></COL> suae in ecclesia Treveris <NOTE N="3158" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> treberis 5. treverensi 6.</NOTE>  beato Petro
tradidit, et amplius recepit sub condicione quam
precariam nominant, ita <NOTE N="3159" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE>  videlicet, ut cum ipsa
de hac luce migraret, utraque data simul <NOTE N="3160" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> sit 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . scilicet 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . s. d. 5.
6.</NOTE>  et
accepta in beati Petri et episcopi jus libere transirent,
et <NOTE N="3161" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">pergit</HI>  6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  quod episcopo ex his facere <NOTE N="3162" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> . fieri B1.</NOTE>  placuisset,
liberam potestatem haberet. Hujus comitissae
neptem, filii filiam, Heinricus quidam dux <NOTE N="3163" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE> , cujus
dicionis <NOTE N="3164" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> condicionis B1.</NOTE>  erat castellum quod vulgo Lempurch
 <NOTE N="3165" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> lemburch 4. 5. 6.
limpurch B4? C. ( <HI REND="ITALIC">in</HI>  C1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">super</HI>  p  <HI REND="ITALIC">al. manu</HI>  b  <HI REND="ITALIC">scriptum est</HI> ).—vocatur l. 6.</NOTE>  nominatur, duxit in matrimonium; qui decurso
aliquanti temporis spacio, eadem bona ecclesiae tollere
et in suos usus vendicare [nitebatur <NOTE N="3166" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita</HI>  C. conatus est vendicare
4. studuit tollere et in s. usus convertere 6. v. studebat B4?  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn.</HI></NOTE> ].
Propter quod cum fuisset saepius ab episcopo ad
satisfactionem vocatus et nollet desistere, sequestratus
est a communione ecclesiae; cumque nec
 <COL N="1205C"></COL> ideo manus suas ab incepta malicia <NOTE N="3167" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> manus malicia B2.</NOTE>  contineret,
immo magis et alia episcopatus bona devastaret,
episcopus maledixit ei anathemate maranatha. Cui
nec sic quidem ab impugnacione desistenti, sed et
 <NOTE N="3168" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.
6. C.</NOTE>  adversus ipsam civitatem Treverim cum magna
armatorum manu venienti, episcopus, convocata ad
se liberorum et ministerialium ecclesiae <NOTE N="3169" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP></NOTE>  multitudine
 <NOTE N="3170" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> non adeo m. B1. 2.</NOTE>  gravi, statuto die occurrit, et adjutorio Dei
et <NOTE N="3171" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> ac 6.—petri  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  beati Petri, istius partis <NOTE N="3172" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> parti 5. p. i. 6. satis
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  satis admodum modico <NOTE N="3173" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> parvo 5. 6.</NOTE> ,
illius vero permaximo detrimento et confusione <NOTE N="3174" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> d. confusioneque 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> ,
ad <NOTE N="3175" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> eum ad 6.</NOTE>  propria redire coegit. Post multum
 <COL N="1206A"></COL> vero temporis cum idem dux inflictum sibi anathema
parvipenderet, et in malis supradictis <NOTE N="3176" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> predictis 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  et similibus
perseveraret, accidit <NOTE N="3177" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">pergit codd.</HI> 
B5.</NOTE>  ut quidam de militibus
ejus die quadam in domum ejus advenisset, et facta
hora prandii apposita mensa coram ipso panem
comedere <NOTE N="3178" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> commedere C1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita infra.</HI></NOTE>  debuisset, et <NOTE N="3179" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE>  dux illi illudens <NOTE N="3180" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> illudens illi B2. C.</NOTE> :
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Surge,</HI>  ait,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et foras egredere, coram me comessurus</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3181" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> commessurus B2. C1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">non es; excommunicatus enim es.</HI>  Et ille:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ubi,</HI> 
inquit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et quis me praeter eum qui et</HI> <NOTE N="3182" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">te excommunicavit?</HI> 
Cui dux ait:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Ecce nunc vide, jam parebit</HI> <NOTE N="3183" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> parebit  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  patebit 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . apparebit B2. patebit C6.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">si ita sumus excommunicati</HI> <NOTE N="3184" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> communicavit  <HI REND="ITALIC">pergit</HI>  B3.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ut</HI> <NOTE N="3185" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> aut 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">aliquid nobis</HI> <NOTE N="3186" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> e. n. B1. 2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">exinde molestiae possit accidere. Si
hic canis</HI> —qui forte illis edentibus aderat— <HI REND="ITALIC">buccellam</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3187" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> bucellam 6.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et alii fortasse.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">quam</HI> <NOTE N="3188" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">illi dedero comederit, non pertimesco,
sin autem, timenda est nobis</HI> <NOTE N="3189" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> vobis 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">excommunicatio
 <COL N="1206B"></COL> et petenda reconciliatio.</HI>  Et hoc dicto, misit
buccellam; quam canis ut naribus adhibuit, ultra
contingere non curavit. Et ne quis hoc canis saturitati
 <NOTE N="3190" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> saturitati canis 6. C. quis cani saturato 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  potuerit <NOTE N="3191" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> possit 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . posset 6.</NOTE>  inputare, cum alius illi <NOTE N="3192" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> sibi C6.</NOTE> 
buccellam mitteret, festinus arripuit <NOTE N="3193" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> apparuit B1.</NOTE> . Unde
omnes qui aderant summa admiracione ducti <NOTE N="3194" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE> ,
una voce dixerunt oportere eos ad satisfactionem
venire. Et ita fecerunt. Sit ergo nomen Domini
benedictum in secula  <CITN>(Ps. CXII, 2)</CITN> , qui sacerdotum
licet peccatorum tamen in multitudine clementiae
suae preces exaudit, et quod nostra parvitas
in terris ligat, apud ipsum quoque ligatum <NOTE N="3195" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> ligata B2. 5. C.</NOTE>  esse
confirmat, juxta quod ipse <NOTE N="3196" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6.</NOTE>  beato Petro et per
ipsum ecclesiae <NOTE N="3197" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> universe e. 6.</NOTE>  promisit, dicens:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Quodcumque
ligaveris super terram erit ligatum et in coelis</HI> 
 <COL N="1206C"></COL> <CITN>(Matth. XVI, 19)</CITN> , et reliqua <NOTE N="3198" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> et rel  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> . cetera B4. 5.
et quodcumque s. s. t. e. s. et in celis 6. <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .  <SUP>d</SUP> .</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="1206">17. <NOTE N="3199" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LXVI.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn., totum caput deest</HI>  B5. De nece
Judeorum  <HI REND="ITALIC">add.</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  Ea tempestate ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an.</HI>  1096) populus multus
utriusque sexus ex <NOTE N="3200" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  omni terra et natione Jerusalem
ire intenderunt <NOTE N="3201" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> contenderunt B1.</NOTE> , et totis desideriis anhelabant
 <NOTE N="3202" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> hanelabant 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  pro Dei et fidei <NOTE N="3203" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> dei fideique 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  amore aut ipsi mortem
suscipere aut incredulorum colla fidei subjugare, et
hac mentis intentione incitati decreverunt primum
 <NOTE N="3204" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE>  Judaeos in civitatibus et castellis ubicumque
habitarent persequi, et cogere illos <NOTE N="3205" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> eos 4.</NOTE>  aut <NOTE N="3206" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> ad 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
dominum Jhesum Christum Deum credere, aut sub
ipsa hora vitae <NOTE N="3207" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1205" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1205"></COL> mortis periculo 6.</NOTE>  periculis subjacere <NOTE N="(496)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1206" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1206C"></COL> Cf. Ekkehardum a. 1096.</NOTE> . Cumque
 <COL N="1207A"></COL> eodem fervore <NOTE N="3208" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> f. incitati c. 4. 5. 6. B4?</NOTE>  civitati Treverorum appropinquassent <NOTE N="3209" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> appropinquarent 6.</NOTE> ,
Judaei qui ibi habitabant similia sibi
arbitrantes fieri, quidam ex eis accipientes parvulos
suos, defixerunt cultros in ventribus eorum, dicentes,
ne forte christianorum vesaniae ludibrio fierent,
debere eos <NOTE N="3210" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> se eos 4. se  <HI REND="ITALIC">post add.</HI>  C1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita</HI>  C3.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">sqq.</HI></NOTE>  in sinum Habrahae transmittere.
Quaedam autem <NOTE N="3211" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> etiam C6.</NOTE>  ex mulieribus eorum, ascendentes
super pontem fluminis et adimpletis <NOTE N="3212" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> fl. impletis 4.</NOTE> 
sinibus earum <NOTE N="3213" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> eorum 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . suis 6.</NOTE>  et manicis lapidibus, praecipitaverunt
se in profundum. Reliqui vero, quibus adhuc
vivere <NOTE N="3214" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> a viv.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  B1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ubi alia manu</HI> 
aliquid cordis  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr. est.</HI></NOTE>  cordi erat, assumptis secum rebus suis
et liberis, in palacium <NOTE N="(497)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207C"></COL> Palatium, prius grande Romanorum monumentum,
postea regum Francorum palatium, tractu
temporis archiepiscoporum Trevirensium habitatio,
 <COL N="1208C"></COL> nostro tempore in mansionem militum transformatum
est.  <ED>WYTT.</ED></NOTE> , quod est asyle <NOTE N="3215" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> asylum 6. asile  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  asilium 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . asilum 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
Treverorum, ubi ipsa hora Egilbertus manebat, confugerunt,
et coeperunt lacrymis flagitare suffragium.
Ille vero nacta oportunitate, super conversione <NOTE N="3216" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> c. eorum eos C.</NOTE> 
 <COL N="1207B"></COL> eos admonens, ita exorsus est:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Miseri, nunc venerunt
super vos peccata vestra quae operati estis, filium
Dei blasphemando et sanctissimae genitrici ejus detrahendo,
ipsum quidem in carne venisse negando, et</HI> <NOTE N="3217" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> matri
vero e. superfluitate 6.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">matri ejus superfluitatibus verborum vestrorum derogando.
Ecce jam hujus rei causa ad summam vitae</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3218" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">vestrae desperationem devenistis; et vobis</HI> <NOTE N="3219" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> et e. v. 6.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ego dico, si in hac infidelitate vestra perseveraveritis</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3220" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> perseveratis C.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">corpore simul et anima peribitis. Vos pro</HI> <NOTE N="3218" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">similitudine patrum vestrorum, qui</HI> <NOTE N="3221" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ante Christi
adventum ipsum venturum</HI> <NOTE N="3222" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> in c. v. 4?
6. B1? 3?</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">in carne crediderunt,
vobismet ipsis blandientes promittitis</HI> <NOTE N="3223" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> promitto 5.</NOTE> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">Profecto</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3224" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> p. (proficto 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <SUP>b</SUP> .  <SUP>d</SUP> .) ipsum jam v. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nisi jam ipsum venisse, et quae redemptionis</HI> <NOTE N="3225" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> ad redemtionem 6. quem
pro r. 4. ipsum venturum in carne C6.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">humani generis ipsum acturum scripturae</HI> <NOTE N="3226" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> r. s. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">referunt,
adimpleta esse cognoveritis</HI> <NOTE N="3227" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> noveritis 4. cognoscitis 6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ipsi vos fallitis. Quae
 <COL N="1207C"></COL> vos stulticia vel magis duricia coartat, ut, cum prophetica
scripta legatis, non retractetis, vobiscum
cogitantes, quam brevis temporis spacium adventus
ejus in carne</HI> <NOTE N="3228" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> in c.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Daniel</HI> <NOTE N="3229" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> dd.  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  daniel 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . david  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  daniel 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . david 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . B. C3. propheta  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">propheta commemorat,
et quot</HI> <NOTE N="3230" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> quod B2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI> 
quot 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">exinde anni defluxerunt</HI> <NOTE N="3231" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> fluxerunt 4. 5. 6.</NOTE> ? « <HI REND="ITALIC">Septuaginta,
inquid, ebdomadae abbreviatae sunt super
populum tuum, et super urbem sanctam</HI> <NOTE N="3232" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> sanctam civitatem B4?</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">tuam,
ut consummetur</HI> <NOTE N="3233" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> consumatur 5. B1. consummatur B2.
4.  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  consummetur C1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">praevaricatio, et finem accipiat
peccatum, et deleatur iniquitas, et adducatur justitia
sempiterna, et impleatur visio prophetae</HI> <NOTE N="3234" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> et prophetiae 4.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ungatur
sanctus sanctorum</HI>   <CITN>(Dan. IX, 24)</CITN> .»  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nonne scientiam
litterarum vestrarum</HI> <NOTE N="3235" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">bonam habetis? Utique
 <COL N="1208A"></COL> magnum vobis posset existere gaudium et fidei
incitamentum de assumptione generis vestri in</HI> <NOTE N="3236" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C3. 4.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Deum.</HI>  Hoc autem dicebat <NOTE N="3237" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. a. ideo dixit
6.</NOTE> , quia, ut quidam
sanctorum <NOTE N="3238" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  dicit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Infidelibus est</HI> <NOTE N="3239" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> esse B1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">blandiendum,
ut ad fidem convertantur, et ipsi</HI> <NOTE N="3240" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> judei 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . ipsi judei 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .  <SUP>d</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">de generis sui
nobilitate gloriantur.</HI>  Et adjunxit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nunc itaque
acquiescite peticionibus meis et consiliis, et</HI> <NOTE N="3241" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">convertimini
et baptizemini</HI> <NOTE N="3242" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> baptizamini 6. baptizemini
 <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  baptizamini C1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ita</HI>  C3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">sqq.</HI>  baptizabimini C6.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et ego restituam vos cum
pace et salute possessionibus</HI> <NOTE N="3243" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> et p. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">vestris, et deinceps
ab adversantibus tuebor vos.</HI>  Cum haec et his <NOTE N="3244" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> 
similia ad illos diceret, unus ex illis legis doctor,
cui <NOTE N="3245" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> micheas
nomine 6.</NOTE>  nomen erat Micheas, coepit dicere:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vere,
sicut dixisti, necessarium est</HI> <NOTE N="3246" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nobis, magis</HI> <NOTE N="3247" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6.</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">christianorum fidei nos jungere, quam de die in diem
taliter</HI> <NOTE N="3248" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. B1.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">vitae nostrae et possessionum periculis</HI> <NOTE N="3249" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> periculo C.</NOTE> 
 <COL N="1208B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">subjacere. Age ergo, quomodo credere debeamus edissere
et adjuva quatinus liberemur de manibus eorum
qui foris</HI> <NOTE N="3250" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> pro foribus B1. 4? q.
pro foris  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  q. p. foribus C1. qui foribus C3. 4. prae foribus C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">sunt, quaerentium nos perdere</HI> <NOTE N="3251" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6.</NOTE> . Et
ait episcopus:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Haec est fides catholica, sine qua
nemo salvari</HI> <NOTE N="3252" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> s. n. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">potest: ut credatis</HI> <NOTE N="3253" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> credamus 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">in Deum
patrem omnipotentem creatorem omnium creaturarum,
et in</HI> <NOTE N="3254" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> et chr. jhesum 5.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Jhesum Christum filium ejus, qui cum patre
unius est substantiae, quem Deus pater ante omnia tempora</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3255" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> secula 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">genuit nativitate illa ineffabili, de</HI> <NOTE N="3256" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C3.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">qua
dicit Esayas</HI> <NOTE N="3257" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> ysai 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . ysayas 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . ysaias 6. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">propheta: «Generationem ejus quis
enarrabit?</HI> <NOTE N="3258" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> ennarravit 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  enarrabit 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <CITN>(Isai. LVIII, 8.)</CITN> »  <HI REND="ITALIC">Qui quidem cum
homines per multimoda vicia incedentes ad tantam
devenissent insipientiam, ut neglecto creatore
suo debitum Deo idolis manu factis honorem
 <COL N="1208C"></COL> inpenderent, sicut</HI> <NOTE N="3258*" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> sicuti C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">est infinitae misericordiae, condoluit
perdicioni eorum, et</HI> <NOTE N="3259" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ut eos ab errore et
perdicione, quae de hac vita decedentes</HI> <NOTE N="3260" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> discedentes 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">excipiebat,
liberaret: manens quod erat, suscepit quod non erat,
ex voluntate Patris, cooperante Spiritu.</HI> <NOTE N="3261" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> sancto
sp. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">sancto,
homo verus per immaculatae virginis uterum sine viri</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3262" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> virili C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">semine natus est; quem, quia filium Dei se esse
dicebat</HI> <NOTE N="3263" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> esse se d. B. se d. esse C.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">patres vestri crucifixerunt et vos ipsorum</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3264" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> suo 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">maledicto devinxerunt dicentes: «Sanguis
ejus super nos et super filios nostros</HI>   <CITN>(Matth. XXV,
25)</CITN> ».  <HI REND="ITALIC">Verumptamen vos hoc maledictum</HI> <NOTE N="3265" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> h. m. vos C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">evadere
potestis, si in</HI> <NOTE N="3266" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ipsum firmo corde credideritis et de
peccatis vestris ipsum vobis propicium</HI> <NOTE N="3267" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1207" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1207"></COL> f. p. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">fieri rogaveritis</HI> 
 <COL N="1209A"></COL> <NOTE N="3268" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> postulaveritis 4. 5. 6.</NOTE> ;  <HI REND="ITALIC">qui post passionem suam effracto inferno,
et his</HI> <NOTE N="3269" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">qui in adventu</HI> <NOTE N="3270" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> adventum B2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ejus crediderunt
inde erutis, die tercia Deus</HI> <NOTE N="3271" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> v. d. et verus h. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">verus et homo resurgens
a mortuis, abhinc die 40, videntibus</HI> <NOTE N="3272" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> v. his
6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">qui
digni erant, ad</HI> <NOTE N="3273" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> ascendit ad c. 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">coelos ascendit, ubi sedet in dextera
Dei patris sui, aequalis ei</HI> <NOTE N="3274" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et coaeternus in
divinitate</HI> <NOTE N="3275" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> deitate 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">inde venturus ad</HI> <NOTE N="3276" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> ad i.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">judicium in novissimo
dierum, Deus verus et homo, reddere unicuique
prout gessit in corpore sive bonum sive malum.
Nec minus credendum est in</HI> <NOTE N="3277" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> . et in B2.
4. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Spiritum sanctum,
qui ex Patre et Filio procedens, universa condita vivificat,
aequalis et consubstantialis per omnia in divinitate</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3278" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> deitate 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Deo Patri et Filio, propter</HI> <NOTE N="3279" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> propter—majestatem  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  6 <SUP>a</SUP> . et propterea fides 5 <SUP>a</SUP>  propter et fides 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . propter
hoc fides 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . <SUP>d</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">quod et fides
christiana</HI> <NOTE N="3280" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> christianorum 4. 5. 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . <SUP>d</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">trium deitatem</HI> <NOTE N="3281" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> deitates 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . divinitates 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . deitate B1. deitatis B2. 4. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">personarum unam</HI> <NOTE N="3282" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> eandem 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . <SUP>d</SUP> .</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">praedicat esse</HI> <NOTE N="3283" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . <SUP>d</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">essentiam, aequalem majestatem.
 <COL N="1209B"></COL> Hanc fidem catholicam per</HI> <NOTE N="3284" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> c. sancta per 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">orbem confitetur ecclesia,
in qua unum</HI> <NOTE N="3285" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> mundatur in r. credentibus 5.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">datur baptisma in remissionem
peccatorum credentibus, in qua juste et pie
viventes post hujus vitae decursum, corporibus nostris
hisdem quibus nunc paremus immortalitate vestitis,
speramus communionem sanctorum percipere et fruituros</HI> 
 <NOTE N="3286" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> f. nos 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">aeterna beatitudine, male vero operantes,
non confessos et inemendatos in aeterno arsuros incendio.</HI> 
Tunc Micheas, his <NOTE N="3287" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> his  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  is C1. is 5. 6.</NOTE>  videlicet quo hortante
 <NOTE N="3288" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> v. cohoortante B1.</NOTE>  hanc <NOTE N="3289" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  fidei edicionem episcopus exorsus
est, ait:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Testificor tibi per Deum, quia quae
locutus es credo, et ecce jam judaismo abrenuncio,
et quae nunc michi non satis plene</HI> <NOTE N="3290" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> plane 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> . C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">sunt intellecta,
cum nobis tempus pacis et tranquillitatis</HI> <NOTE N="3291" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> tranquillitas
B2.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">adveniet</HI> <NOTE N="3292" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> advenerit 4. 5. 6.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">perquirere curabo. Tantum nunc</HI> <NOTE N="3293" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">accelera</HI> 
 <COL N="1209C"></COL> <NOTE N="3294" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> festina 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">nos baptizare</HI> <NOTE N="3295" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> babtizare B2.</NOTE> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ut possimus manus quaerentium
nos evadere.</HI>  Similiter et alii <NOTE N="3296" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> o. alii 5.</NOTE>  omnes dixerunt.
Tunc episcopus baptizavit illum <NOTE N="3297" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> eos 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . eum 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> . 6.</NOTE> , nomen
suum inponens ei, alios autem presbiteri qui aderant
baptizabant. Sed ut de cetero <NOTE N="3298" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> ceteris 5 <SUP>b</SUP>  de c. de his t. 6.</NOTE>  taceam, aliis omnibus
in sequenti anno apostatantibus <NOTE N="3299" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> apostantibus 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> , iste <NOTE N="3300" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> i. solus C.</NOTE> 
adhaerens episcopo in fide permansit. Non ergo audebo
nunc dicere, quod istius conversio <NOTE N="3301" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> anime
c. sit c. s. 6.</NOTE>  sit animae
convertentis salvatio, cum scriptum sit, quia
 <HI REND="ITALIC">qui converti fecerit peccatorem ab errore viae suae,
salvabit animam ejus</HI> <NOTE N="3302" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> suam C3. 4.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">a morte</HI>   <CITN>(Jac. V, 20)</CITN> , ejus
 <COL N="1210A"></COL> inquam, id est suam et conversi. Cum ad Ezechielem
 <NOTE N="3303" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> ihezechihelem 6. hiezechielem C.</NOTE>  Dominus dixerit, quod <NOTE N="3304" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  si annunciaverit
impio viam suam malam et ille conversus non fuerit,
ipse tamen mercedem suam <NOTE N="3305" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 6.</NOTE>  non amiserit.
Sic enim dicit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Si autem tu annunciaveris impio et
ille non fuerit conversus</HI> <NOTE N="3306" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> c. n. f. C.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">a via sua mala, ipse</HI> <NOTE N="3307" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> non 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
 <HI REND="ITALIC">quidem in iniquitate sua morietur, tu autem animam
tuam liberasti</HI>   <CITN>(Ezech. III, 19)</CITN> .—Praeterea <NOTE N="3308" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Novum caput incipit</HI>  C.</NOTE>  multa
alia bona <NOTE N="3309" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> b. idem Egilbertus C.</NOTE>  operatus est, quae enumerare longum
est. Hoc tantum <NOTE N="3310" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> autem 6 <SUP>a</SUP> . etiam
6 <SUP>c</SUP> . tamen B 1.</NOTE>  sciendum, quod elemosinas
pauperibus largas faciebat et ecclesiis bona plurima
conferebat, sed et <NOTE N="3311" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  ab antecessoribus suis aliquibus
 <NOTE N="3312" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> ablata al. restituebat 6.</NOTE>  ablata reconsignavit <NOTE N="3313" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> resignavit q. in ejus m. test. in b. 5.</NOTE> , quorum testamenta
in ejus memoriam in bibliothecis usque hodie <NOTE N="3314" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI> 
C 6.</NOTE> 
sunt recondita <NOTE N="3315" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> reposita 6.</NOTE> ; quae omnia ego pusillus qui
 <COL N="1210B"></COL> haec scribo ad redemptionem animae ejus profutura
sperarem, sed sententiae beati Augustini non audeo
praejudicare. Dicit enim:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Omni homini, qui ecclesiae
catholicae non tenet unitatem, neque baptismus neque
elemosina quamlibet copiosa neque mors pro Christi
nomine suscepta proficere poterit ad salutem, quando
in eo vel heretica vel scismatica pravitas perseverat</HI> <NOTE N="3316" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> pers. pr. C.</NOTE> ,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">quae ducit ad mortem.</HI> —Mortuus est autem
anno dominicae incarnationis 1101, die Nonarum
Septembrium <NOTE N="(497*)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209C"></COL> 3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Non. Sept.</HI>  Necrol. S. Maximini.</NOTE> , et sepultus est in ecclesia
majori, domo videlicet sancti Petri apostoli <NOTE N="3317" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C3. 4.</NOTE> . Sedit
in episcopatu annos <NOTE N="3318" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> annis XXII. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . annis v. duobus 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  viginti duos, menses octo <NOTE N="3319" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> VII. 5.</NOTE> ,
dies tres, et vacavit episcopatus fere <NOTE N="3320" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> . C. quasi 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  menses
quattuor.</P> <P COM="1210"><COL N="1210C"></COL> 18 <NOTE N="3321" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">c.</HI>  LXVII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Leibn.</HI></NOTE> . In diebus illis fuerunt <NOTE N="3322" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest hoc loco</HI>  5.</NOTE>  ex copioso
Trevericae civitatis clero quam plures hac <NOTE N="3323" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> h. d. successione
fuerunt 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> . d. fuerunt 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  sacerdocii
successione dignissimi; inter quos erat quidam
Bruno nomine <NOTE N="3324" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> n. br. 5.</NOTE> , Francus natione, insignis nobilitate,
utpote quem pater Arnoldus comes <NOTE N="(498)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1210" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1210C"></COL> A. Bretten et Laufen.  <ED>WYTT.</ED></NOTE>  ex
nobilissima Adeleyda <NOTE N="3325" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> adelleida 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> . m. adeleida 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . 6. adeleida B1. adelheida
B 4. 5. C.</NOTE>  matre genuerat, forma
praestantissimus, litteris satis <NOTE N="3326" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> sacris C.</NOTE>  eruditus, consilio
cautus, plus quam dici potest munificus <NOTE N="3327" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> magnificus 6.</NOTE> .
Quibus rebus ita <NOTE N="3328" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> . ergo p. ita se d. 5.</NOTE>  erga se principes devinxerat, ut
non solum praeposituris <NOTE N="3329" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> prepositus
C.</NOTE>  majorum ecclesiarum
in Treveri et Spira, verum etiam beati Florini <NOTE N="3330" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> flo <ORNAMENT IMAGE="1541209A" TEXT="[Symbol]"></ORNAMENT>   <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  florini 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . florum 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . flori 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . florencii 6.</NOTE> 
in Confluentia et <NOTE N="3331" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1209" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1209"></COL> sub  <HI REND="ITALIC">post add.</HI>  6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  archidiaconatus eum dignitate
 <COL N="1211A"></COL> <NOTE N="3332" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> honore 6.</NOTE>  sublimassent. De hoc suggestum <NOTE N="3333" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> gestum est 6. s. est B1? C.</NOTE>  imperatori,
ut eum Trevericae praeficeret ecclesiae. Eo siquidem
anno Heinricus rex quartus, imperator <NOTE N="3334" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> imperio 4. 5.</NOTE> 
tercius, habita curia natalem <NOTE N="3335" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> natale C.</NOTE>  Domini celebravit
in Mogontia <NOTE N="(499)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211C"></COL> Cf. Ekkehardum h. a.</NOTE> , ubi eum adeuntes cives Treverici
 <NOTE N="3336" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> tr. c. 5.</NOTE>  petierunt sibi episcopum dari. Quibus
mox petentibus, principibus et civibus <NOTE N="3337" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> cons. civibus 6.</NOTE>  consentientibus,
Brunonem eis <NOTE N="3338" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  consecrari jussit. Denique
ibidem ordinatus est <NOTE N="3339" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> C6.  <HI REND="ITALIC">in margine:</HI>  a. d. i. 1101.</NOTE>  Idus Januarii ( <HI REND="ITALIC">an.</HI>  1102)
ab <NOTE N="3340" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 4. 5. C.</NOTE>  Adalberone <NOTE N="3341" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> adelberone
4. edelberone 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> . 6. C. edelbrione 5 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  Mettensis ecclesiae episcopo,
oleum sacrae benedictionis inponente, Johanne Spirensi,
