 <COL N="1211B"></COL> die <NOTE N="3347" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> in die 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  purificationis sanctae <NOTE N="3348" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> beatae ac sanctae
