et cum magno populi <NOTE N="3349" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 1. g. p. C.</NOTE>  gaudio susceptus
est. Anno <NOTE N="3350" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Novum incipit caput</HI>  C.</NOTE>  igitur <NOTE N="3351" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> autem 6.</NOTE>  ordinationis suae <NOTE N="3352" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> ejus 4.</NOTE>  tercio
