sui <NOTE N="3355" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6. m. s. c.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  causa, invenit domnum Pascalem <NOTE N="3356" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> paschalem papam 6.</NOTE> 
universali sinodo praesidentem, papatus <NOTE N="3357" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> papae 4.</NOTE>  sui jam
annum octavum <NOTE N="3358" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> nonum B 1.</NOTE>  agentem. A quo honorifice
susceptus <NOTE N="3359" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> s. est 4. 6. C.</NOTE> —utpote Belgicae Galliae primae metropolis
praesul magnificus; ad cujus praesulatum
ex <NOTE N="3360" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4.</NOTE>  permissione beati Petri apostoli <NOTE N="3361" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  suorumque
successorum apostolicorum, quos enumerare
longum est, inviolabilium testamentorum roboratione
totius Galliae atque Germaniae pertinet primatus;
 <COL N="1211C"></COL> ita enim sanctus Silvester beato Agricio quarto
episcoporum Treberensium <NOTE N="3362" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> trever. 5.</NOTE> , quorum nomina
cognita habemus, scribit <NOTE N="3363" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> scripsit 5. 6. B5,  <HI REND="ITALIC">qui hoc loco Silvestri diploma addit</HI>   <CITN>(v. Gesta c. 18.)</CITN> .</NOTE>  inter cetera dicens <NOTE N="(501)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1212" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1212C"></COL> Cf. Gesta c. 18.</NOTE> 

 <POEM COM="1211"><L><HI REND="ITALIC">Sume prioratum post Alpes Trebir</HI> <NOTE N="3364" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> trevir 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .
trebur 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">ubique,</HI></L> <L INDENT=1><HI REND="ITALIC">Quem tibi lege nova Roma dat et veteri;</HI> —</L></POEM> 

honorifice inquam susceptus <NOTE N="3365" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> s. est 4. 5.</NOTE> , sed quoniam episcopalia,
anulum videlicet et baculum, per manum
laicam suscepisset, atque quia <NOTE N="3366" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> ita 4.</NOTE>  ecclesias dedicasset
et clericos necdum pallium consecutus promovisset,
multum aspere correptus <NOTE N="3367" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> correctus 5.</NOTE>  est, et decernente
episcoporum ibi congregatorum concilio,
 <COL N="1212A"></COL> pontificatus officium deposuit, quod <NOTE N="3368" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> et quod 5 <SUP>a</SUP> . <SUP>b</SUP> . et quia 5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  tamen eisdem
 <NOTE N="3369" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> ipsis 4. 5. 6.</NOTE>  intervenientibus, quia <NOTE N="3370" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> et 5.</NOTE>  discrecio ejus
et prudentia officio et tempori conveniens <NOTE N="3371" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> congruens 6.</NOTE>  erat,
post triduum non sine admissorum penitentia recuperavit.
Injuncta est autem <NOTE N="3372" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  4. 5. 6. ei  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE>  ei penitentia, ut
quociens in spacio trium proximorum <NOTE N="3373" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1. a. p. 5. 6.</NOTE>  annorum
missarum sollempnia celebraret, dalmatica non uteretur;
quod ipse humiliter inplevit <NOTE N="3374" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> adimplevit 4.</NOTE> . Deinde accepta
tam apostolici <NOTE N="3375" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> apostolice B2.</NOTE>  quam totius sinodi benedictione,
pallii honore donatus, atque de regula fidei
firmiter <NOTE N="3376" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  observanda instructus, atque <NOTE N="3377" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> sive 6.</NOTE>  de
instructione commissi sibi <NOTE N="3378" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 4. 5. g. s. c. 5. 6.</NOTE>  gregis diligenter
admonitus, in sua cum gaudio remeavit <NOTE N="3379" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Hic, paucis lineis infra
ex c. 25. additis, desinit</HI>  B 5.</NOTE> . Tum <NOTE N="3380" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> tunc 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . B1.</NOTE> 
vero juxta magistri institutionem <NOTE N="3381" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> preceptionem C.</NOTE>  magis quam
ante operibus justiciae coepit <NOTE N="3382" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C.</NOTE>  insistere et verbum
 <COL N="1212B"></COL> sacrae exhortationis quasi mensuram <NOTE N="3383" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> e. m. 6.</NOTE>  evangelici
tritici dominicae familiae fideliter <NOTE N="3384" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI> 
B1. f. et prudenter 6.</NOTE>  erogare,
et quod praedicavit ore, studuit operum executione
confirmare, attentius illud <NOTE N="3385" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  beati Gregorii mente
 <NOTE N="3386" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  pertractans:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Cujus vita despicitur, restat ut
et</HI> <NOTE N="3387" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. B 1. C6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">praedicatio ejus</HI> <NOTE N="3388" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">contempnatur.</HI>  Fuit enim
constans in oracione, devotus in elemosinarum largitione,
pius in viduarum et pupillorum defensione,
excidia domorum Dei nulla sumptus <NOTE N="3389" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> sumptuum
motus magn. 6.</NOTE>  magnitudine
motus reparabat, et si quispiam Deo famulantibus
aliquid intulisset injuriae, inpune praeterire
non sinebat. Verum, ut breviter concludam, talem
se omnimodis exhibebat, ut in <NOTE N="3390" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  administrandis
quoque regni negociis ex omnibus principibus consilio
 <COL N="1212C"></COL> <NOTE N="3391" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> consiliis 5. 6.</NOTE>  et sapientia et auctoritate nullus eo sublimior
haberetur, adeo ut imperator patrem suum
eum vocaverit et majorem ceteris ei <NOTE N="3392" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> c. h. ei 6. ei c. h. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . B2.</NOTE>  honorem
inpenderit <NOTE N="3393" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> impendit 5.</NOTE> . Sed et <NOTE N="3394" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> . C 6.</NOTE>  ab omnibus episcopis,
quacumque se conventui eorum <NOTE N="3395" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  ingessisset, ut
par quidem diligebatur, sed ut <NOTE N="3396" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> sed et ut C6.</NOTE>  major venerabatur.</P> <P COM="1212">19. Igitur quoniam <NOTE N="3397" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> quia 4.</NOTE>  in rebus sibi <NOTE N="3398" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1211"></COL> c. s. 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE>  commissis
