 <COL N="1213A"></COL> quintus rex, adhuc <NOTE N="3402" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  adolescens circiter <NOTE N="3403" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> circa 5. 6. C.</NOTE>  annos
20; ei committitur, ut et <NOTE N="3404" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>  regnum sua prudentia <NOTE N="3405" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> prouidentia 5 <SUP>c</SUP> . 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
disponeret et heredem regni morum suorum honestate
et disciplina, qua ipse prae omnibus pollebat,
informaret, quousque in virum perfectum aetate et
sapientia educatus succrevisset <NOTE N="3406" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> s. succresceret
educauit B 1. educ.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B4. C.</NOTE> . Quem susceptum
tam diu educavit <NOTE N="3407" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 1. 2.</NOTE> , usque dum Adalberti <NOTE N="3408" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> u. ad alberti B. 1.</NOTE> ,
tunc cancellarii postea <NOTE N="3409" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> post 5. vero
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  vero Mogontiensis <NOTE N="3410" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> mogociensis C1.</NOTE> 
episcopi, detractionibus exasperatus, regni et heredis
providentiam proceribus reconsignavit. Quantae
autem pietatis exstiterit, exinde quis <NOTE N="3411" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  colligere
poterit, qui noverit quod, quantumlibet ei <NOTE N="3412" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> quispiam ei 6.</NOTE>  quispiam
molestiae <NOTE N="3413" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 1.</NOTE>  irrogasset, si revertens veniam
postulavit <NOTE N="3414" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> postulauerit 5 <SUP>b</SUP> .
postulasset B1.</NOTE> , facillime ad misericordiam motus
indulsit. Unde factum est ut, cum <NOTE N="3415" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5 <SUP>b</SUP> .</NOTE>  idem Adalbertus,
 <COL N="1213B"></COL> cujus supra <NOTE N="3416" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> ante 6.</NOTE>  memini, Mogontiensium <NOTE N="3417" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> moguntiacensium 4.</NOTE> 
jam <NOTE N="3418" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE>  novus electus, ob illatas regi molestias <NOTE N="3419" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> injurias vel
molestias B1.</NOTE> ,
a rege captus et in carcerem retrusus, non inde
prius exire <NOTE N="3420" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> exire pr. 5 <SUP>b</SUP> . <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE>  potuisset, quam iste, Bruno inquam,
fidem faciendo, numquam illum regi <NOTE N="3421" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> n. r. 5.</NOTE>  nociturum,
pro ipso se obsidem regiae custodiae dedit.
Quid multis moror <NOTE N="3422" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> immoror 5. morer B1.</NOTE> ? Denique cum tanta sollercia
ac sapientia ab ipso res acta est, ut cum in diebus
illis de venalitate sanctae ecclesiae <NOTE N="3423" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> s. dei e. C.</NOTE> , scilicet de
contradictione vendicionis episcopatuum abbaciarum
et aliarum quarumcumque <NOTE N="3424" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> quarumque
C3.</NOTE>  ecclesiasticarum
dignitatum, inter regnum et sacerdotium, sicut
superiori sermone <NOTE N="3425" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  B 1.</NOTE>  decursum est <NOTE N="(502)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213C"></COL> C. 10.</NOTE> , ageretur
 <NOTE N="3426" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">post add.</HI>  6 <SUP>a</SUP> . i. d.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  6.</NOTE>  invidiosa dissensio, ita catholicorum <NOTE N="3427" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> ita in c. 6 <SUP>a</SUP> .</NOTE> 
amplexus est <NOTE N="3428" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> sit 6.</NOTE>  consorcium, ut imperatori debitum
 <COL N="1213C"></COL> non denegaret <NOTE N="3429" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> denegarit
B1. negarit B4. negaret C3.</NOTE>  obsequium, neque ita se
caesarianorum communione contaminaverit, ut <NOTE N="3430" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  C6.</NOTE> 
catholicorum offensas <NOTE N="3431" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> offensus B2.</NOTE>  incurreret <NOTE N="3432" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> incurrerit 5. 6 <SUP>c</SUP> .</NOTE> . Propter
quod contigit ut novissime <NOTE N="3433" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  sua prudenti mediatione
 <NOTE N="3434" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> meditatione 4. 5. B2. C. consilio  <HI REND="ITALIC">add. secunda manus</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  imperator <NOTE N="3435" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1213" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1213"></COL> imperatori 6 <SUP>c</SUP> . persuasus  <HI REND="ITALIC">add. secunda
manus</HI>  B1.</NOTE>  apostolico obtemperaret,
